{"id":"n41642-1-8","stage":5,"title":"눈총 · 怒目","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41642-1-8-1","ko":"도서관에서 옆에 앉은 사람이 계속 떠들어서 미치겠어.","zh":"在图书馆里，坐在我旁边的人一直吵个不停，真要疯掉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"도서관에서","meaning":"图书馆","explanation":"도서관：图书馆；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"도서관","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40295","senseId":"1","lemma":"도서관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도서관에서","audio":"/audio/6705409cf4453cc9226f.mp3"}},{"text":"옆에","meaning":"旁边，附近","explanation":"옆：旁边，附近；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20243","senseId":"2","lemma":"옆","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옆에","audio":"/audio/f259a3ee3dd4d4a24841.mp3"}},{"text":"앉은","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉은","audio":"/audio/b98c95bcfcd444b7b080.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续。","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"떠들어서","meaning":"喧闹","explanation":"떠들다：喧闹；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"떠들다","audio":"/audio/11ba432b1719e409c7da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64655","senseId":"1","lemma":"떠들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠들어서","audio":"/audio/90bf2a13d4d9e856cb8a.mp3"}},{"text":"미치겠어.","meaning":"疯","explanation":"미치다：疯；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"미치다","audio":"/audio/80cc63abcc13a4106e78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62742","senseId":"3","lemma":"미치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미치겠어","audio":"/audio/01a5302f5e62048f44fb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ee22c8536d3503a","term":"도서관","zh":"图书馆","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3","entryId":"40295","definition":"收藏大量书籍和资料等，以供人们借阅或学习而建造的设施。","pronunciation":["도서관"]},{"id":"c140e1936b454b24","term":"옆","zh":"旁边，附近","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3","entryId":"20243","definition":"离某地不远的地方。","pronunciation":["엽"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"11ba432b1719e409","term":"떠들다","zh":"喧闹","audio":"/audio/11ba432b1719e409c7da.mp3","entryId":"64655","definition":"喧哗吵闹。","pronunciation":["떠ː들다"]},{"id":"80cc63abcc13a410","term":"미치다","zh":"疯","audio":"/audio/80cc63abcc13a4106e78.mp3","entryId":"62742","definition":"由于某个状态非常严重，像精神将要跨掉一样感到痛苦。","pronunciation":["미치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/028ccd305e7d3e6cade0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41642-1-8-2","ko":"눈총만 주지 말고 직접 조용히 하라고 얘기를 해.","zh":"别只是瞪他，直接去让他安静下来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈총만","meaning":"怒目，怒视，瞪","explanation":"눈총：怒目，怒视，瞪；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"눈총","audio":"/audio/d484b30b9f736fe0d05b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41642","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈총","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈총만","audio":"/audio/3e7c71cf0c064ce4cefc.mp3"}},{"text":"주지","meaning":"使感到，使受到，带来","explanation":"주다：使感到，使受到，带来；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"3","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주지","audio":"/audio/509f8c1c91f136687ac0.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲手，亲自","explanation":"직접：亲手，亲自。","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71493","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}},{"text":"조용히","meaning":"安静地","explanation":"조용히：安静地。","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}},{"text":"하라고","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하라고","audio":"/audio/80ec1d987ac3f29ca025.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기를","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기를","audio":"/audio/d30eac53cdc9b914c064.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d484b30b9f736fe0","term":"눈총","zh":"怒目，怒视，瞪","audio":"/audio/d484b30b9f736fe0d05b.mp3","entryId":"41642","definition":"由于讨厌或憎恶而注视的锐利目光。","pronunciation":["눈총"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"使感到，使受到，带来","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"让别人经历某事或产生某种情绪。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"20c483bdda9706e4","term":"직접","zh":"亲手，亲自","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3","entryId":"71493","definition":"没有人或物介入在中间而直接。","pronunciation":["직쩝"]},{"id":"ae038c58a1186312","term":"조용히","zh":"安静地","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3","entryId":"75797","definition":"任何声音都没有地。","pronunciation":["조용히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。；办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"谈话，说话","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"向某人诉说与某事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等有关的话。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]}],"audio":"/audio/3be176220ac43aa2ccef.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.536,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41642","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":171,"sequenceScore":3.3627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别只是瞪他，直接去让他安静下来吧。","在图书馆里，坐在我旁边的人一直吵个不停，真要疯掉了。","那位女士是金老师的母亲吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在图书馆里，坐在我旁边的人一直吵个不停，真要疯掉了。","那位女士是金老师的母亲吗？","别只是瞪他，直接去让他安静下来吧。"],"answer":2}]}
